<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC H1 NET PROFIT RISES 84 PCT.</title>
<headline>SBC H1 NET PROFIT RISES 84 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1,326	     vs   722</p>
<p> Gross operating profit     2,617	     vs 2,060</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Swiss Bank Corp. (SBC). Analysts had forecast a rise in first-half net profit of 50-70 percent.  </p>
<p> Net interest income	  1,559	   vs   1,436</p>
<p> Fee, commission income     2,719	   vs   2,113</p>
